  <h2 id="arrows">Real arrows</h2>
  <p>
    <code>add_connector(MSO_CONNECTOR.STRAIGHT, ...)</code> draws a bare line — no arrowhead.
    <code>add_arrow</code> produces a connector with a real arrowhead and auto-routed endpoints
    (mid-edge of the target shape, pulled back by <code>inset_pt</code>):
  </p>
